- The command can be applied at the global BGP, group, or neighbor level for granular control.  
- Inactive routes (backup paths) will now be advertised to these peers, while the best active route continues to forward traffic.  

**Verification:**  
After configuration, check advertised routes to peers using:  
```  
show router bgp neighbor <ip> advertised-routes  
```  
