- Propagates multiple unlabeled IPv4 paths via BGP Add-Path
- Enables ECMP load-sharing locally (`multipath`)
- Allows granular control via export policies
- Ensures fast convergence by pre-advertising backup paths
- Maintains MPLS-free operation for upstream providers
