To enable BGP for labeled IPv6 unicast and multicast VPN on your Nokia 7750 SR routers while preserving existing IPv4 peerings, configure the required address families and BGP add-paths for labeled IPv6:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group <peer-group-name>
